@* One image whose source, box, fit and loading are parameters. Width and Height reserve the box before
   the image arrives, and with Contain or Cover they are the box the image is fitted into. The group
   around the image is the stage a host can frame. The line under it is the markup the component writes,
   to read the attributes without opening the browser tools. *@
<OmniStack Gap="OmniSpacing.Medium" Align="OmniAlignment.Center">
    <OmniStack Align="OmniAlignment.Center" Justify="OmniJustification.Center" role="group" aria-label="Image preview">
        <OmniImage Source="@SampleImages.SourceOf(Source)"
                   Alt="@SampleImages.AltOf(Source)"
                   Width="@SampleImages.WidthOf(Box)"
                   Height="@SampleImages.HeightOf(Box)"
                   Fit="Fit"
                   Loading="Loading" />
    </OmniStack>
    <code>@Markup</code>
</OmniStack>
